<title>USA: Guarantee Life completes buyback.</title>
<headline>Guarantee Life completes buyback.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA, Neb. 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Guarantee Life Cos Inc said it repurchased 712,581 common shares from 18,255 accounts at an average daily closing price of $19.86 per share, less a processing fee of $0.85 per share, under an odd-lot buyback.</p>
<p>The buyback was voluntary and involved shareholders with fewer than 100 shares as of April 16, said the insurer.</p>
<p>Upon completion of the program, shares outstanding totaled 9.2 million, down 7.2 percent from the 9.9 million reported April 28, the company said.</p>
<p>Guarantee estimated it would realize annual cost savings of about $200,000 per year due to the buyback.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
